---
// Footer component with official 321 Clementi mall info and terms
---

<footer class="w-full mt-auto border-t border-clementi-border bg-clementi-white py-6 text-center text-xs text-clementi-slate" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 space-y-4">
    <!-- Brand wordmark echo in Century Gothic -->
    <div class="font-display font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wordmark text-clementi-crimson">
      321 C L E M E N T I
    </div>

    <!-- Address & Location -->
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      <strong>321 Clementi</strong><br />
      321 Clementi Ave 3, Singapore 129905<br />
      <span class="text-[11px] text-clementi-slate/80">Carpark Entry via Clementi Ave 3</span>
    </p>

    <!-- Official Terms & Conditions (Adapted for Autonomous Mobile Redemption) -->
    <div class="bg-clementi-subtle rounded-md p-3.5 text-[11px] text-clementi-slate/90 leading-relaxed border border-clementi-border/60 text-left space-y-2">
      <strong class="text-clementi-charcoal block font-display font-bold text-xs">
        Promotion Terms & Conditions:
      </strong>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-4 space-y-1">
        <li>
          Minimum spend of <strong>$30.00</strong> in a single receipt is required to redeem for <strong>2 hours complimentary parking</strong> on weekdays (12:00 PM – 3:00 PM, excluding public holidays).
        </li>
        <li>
          Redemption is processed directly via this mobile portal on the same day of spend. (No queuing at the Level 3 Information Counter required).
        </li>
        <li>
          Limited to one (1) parking redemption per patron/vehicle per day, regardless of total amount spent.
        </li>
        <li>
          Redemptions are on a first-come-first-served basis and while daily quota lasts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>IU CashCard Notice:</strong> Patrons must remove their CashCard / NETS Motoring Card from the vehicle IU before scanning the barcode at the carpark exit gantry.
        </li>
        <li>
          Patrons enjoy 2 hours free parking. Prevailing carpark charges will apply beyond the stated 2-hour complimentary timing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Exclusions:</strong> This promotion is <u>not applicable</u> to receipts from <em>Clementi Family & Aesthetic Clinic</em> and <em>GynaeMD Women's Clinic</em>.
        </li>
        <li>
          All prices quoted are in Singapore dollars (SGD).
        </li>
        <li>
          This information is correct at time of issuance and subject to change. The Management reserves the right to withdraw or amend terms without prior notice.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <p class="text-[10px] text-clementi-slate/60 pt-1">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} 321 Clementi. All rights reserved. Powered by Autonomous Redemption Engine.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
